  "question": {
    "text": "The Molarity \\((\\mathrm{M})\\) of an aqueous solution containing \\(5.85 \\mathrm{~g}\\) of NaCl in \\(500 \\mathrm{~mL}\\) water is : (Given : Molar Mass \\(\\mathrm{Na}: 23\\) and \\(\\mathrm{Cl}: 35.5 \\mathrm{gmol}^{-1}\\) )",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
